    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Cruise the streets in style.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends in Adrenaline: Online, a chill racing game where you build your custom rides how you want, to represent who you are. Explore the corners of the open-world environment on your own or online with your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/extras/1eeac2ad6aae99525fd05c47c77a792f.avif?t=1742927416\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the city with your friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise around the island alone or with others in online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your new ride in a car meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden secrets in the deepest corners of town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make money your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start impromptu races and challenge the other players where you can risk it all for cash or fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Taxis or Pizza Co. and make a quick buck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try something more relaxing like fishing for goods or dumpster diving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Customize Customize</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose individual parts to change the look and performance of your ride.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new styles and outfits to showcase who YOU are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More player customizable areas to come soon.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Cruise the streets in style.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join your friends in Adrenaline: Online, a chill racing game where you build your custom rides how you want, to represent who you are. Explore the corners of the open-world environment on your own or online with your crew.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466260/extras/1eeac2ad6aae99525fd05c47c77a792f.avif?t=1742927416\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the city with your friends</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cruise around the island alone or with others in online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Show off your new ride in a car meet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden secrets in the deepest corners of town.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Make money your way</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start impromptu races and challenge the other players where you can risk it all for cash or fame.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Taxis or Pizza Co. and make a quick buck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try something more relaxing like fishing for goods or dumpster diving.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customize Customize Customize</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose individual parts to change the look and performance of your ride.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new styles and outfits to showcase who YOU are.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More player customizable areas to come soon.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Adrenaline: Online is a casual, open-world, racing game. Join your friends online to drive, explore, race and work jobs together; earning cash to customize and upgrade your ride and show off in style.",
